# Per-Dockerfile ignore for docker/runtime/Dockerfile.
# BuildKit ≥1.5 picks this up automatically when -f points at this Dockerfile.
#
# Goal: ship ONLY what the runtime image needs (ai-agent + docker/runtime/),
# not the dashboard / cli / docs / .git of the full monorepo. Cuts the build
# context from gigabytes to tens of MB.

# --- Version control ---
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github

# --- Sibling apps the runtime image does not need ---
dashboard/
# ADR 0008 §F2: the procway CLI is now baked into the runtime image at
# /opt/procway/cli so dev-mode sessions don't need procway repo on
# /workspace. Keep cli/ in the build context.
# cli/    (do not exclude)
procway/
docs/
scripts/
# …except the git credential helper, which the Dockerfile bakes into the
# image (COPY scripts/git-credential-procway.mjs). Without this exception the
# build fails: "scripts/git-credential-procway.mjs: not found".
!scripts/git-credential-procway.mjs
skills/
.claude/
.vscode/
.playwright/
.playwright-cli/
.port-registry/
.procway/
ai-agent/
!ai-agent/package.json
!ai-agent/pnpm-lock.yaml
!ai-agent/src/
!ai-agent/web/
!ai-agent/README.md
!ai-agent/LICENSE
temporary/
node_modules/

# --- Dep caches inside any subdir ---
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/.pnpm

# --- Build outputs ---
**/.nuxt
**/.output
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/.vite

# --- Editor / OS ---
.idea
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Logs ---
**/*.log
logs/

# --- Other docker contexts ---
docker-compose*.yml

# --- Misc ---
*.bak
*.tmp
*~
README.md
LICENSE
AGENTS.md
procway-settings.json
vitest.config.mjs
# ADR 0008 §F2: the pnpm workspace metadata is required at /opt/procway
# for the bake-time `pnpm install --prod` to resolve @procway/core and
# root deps (undici, @libsql/client). Keep them in the build context.
# package.json   (do not exclude)
# pnpm-lock.yaml (do not exclude)
